    "text": "\nL_w=3^j,\\qquad U_w=2^{A_j},\\qquad\nC_w=\\sum_{i=0}^{j-1}3^{j-1-i}2^{A_i},\\qquad\nf_w(n)=\\frac{L_wn+C_w}{U_w}.\n"
  },
  {
    "kind": "DisplayMath",
    "text": "\nL_w\\rho_w+C_w\\equiv U_w\\pmod{2U_w},\\qquad 0<\\rho_w<2U_w,\n"
