  {
    "kind": "DisplayMath",
    "text": "\na=a(b,e,\\sigma)=\\min\\{a\\ge1:2^{a+e+2b-\\sigma}<3^{a+b}\\},\n\\quad J=2^{e+2b-\\sigma},\\quad Q=3^{a+b},\\quad K=2^aJ<Q. \\tag{3}\n"
