    "text": "\nW=\\frac{Jz+h_e}{3^a}\n"
  },
  {
    "kind": "DisplayMath",
    "text": "\nx_j=3^j2^{a-j}W-1\\quad(0\\le j\\le a). \\tag{9}\n"
